            <div class="about-wrapper">
                <div data-w-id="13341472-079f-713c-6306-2f1b0e2523d5" class="about-trigger"></div>
                <div class="about-content" data-scroll="overscroll">
                    <div data-w-id="b1788db8-6bae-80a6-64d2-f6972b6a1e25" class="margin-bottom margin--medium">
                        <div class="margin-bottom margin--small">
                            <p class="text--xlarge is--wulkan">It’s been more than <span class="number-font-style font-16">4</span> decades since Sun Builders Group has been credited to be Gujarat’s Premier Real Estate Company. At Sun Builders Group we strongly believe in “Promise, only if you can deliver”.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text--about">With a heritage spanning over four decades, the Sun Builders Group's commitment remains unchanged. We believe in actions, not just mere words. Our belief in 'Promise only if you can deliver' defines our approach. That's the cornerstone of our legacy, and it continues to guide us forward at every step.
                            <br /><br />

                        </p>

                        <p class="text--about">
                            Since inception, our values revolve around three aspects: Quality, Trust, & Commitment. From concept to the completion phase, our focus remains unwavering on upholding these standards in all our ventures while building relations & communities. As a result of this, we've dedicated ourselves to delivering top-tier spaces and ensuring efficient facilities for our clients.<br />
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-item-w">



                        <div class="about-item is--1">
                            <div class="text--med is--wulkan">Promoters </div>
                            <p class="text--about">At the Sun Builders Group, we strongly believe in building communities through the shared leadership of our first & second-generation technocrats, enriched by their vast experiences & expertise. Through this, we have been able to fulfil our promise of guiding communities towards advancement while mirroring our growth with Ahmedabad's evolution, showcasing our commitment to progress.

                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div data-w-id="68032c8f-1186-6c0e-3f09-c2006e6223d6" class="horizontal-line"></div>


                        <div class="about-item is--2">
                            <div class="text--med is--wulkan">Vision</div>
                            <p class="text--about">Our vision is straightforward yet profound: to build environments that inspire, enrich, and endure.




                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div data-w-id="68032c8f-1186-6c0e-3f09-c2006e6223d6" class="horizontal-line"></div>


                        <div class="about-item is--2">
                            <div class="text--med is--wulkan">Expertise </div>
                            <p class="text--about">All our key leaders possess deep knowledge in both Civil Engineering and Urban Planning. This unique blend of expertise enables us to build & timely deliver spaces that resonate with functional aspects catering to our customers' evolving needs and desires, with a focus on creating user-friendly environments that align with upcoming trends in the industry.




                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div data-w-id="68032c8f-1186-6c0e-3f09-c2006e6223d6" class="horizontal-line"></div>
                        <div class="about-item is--2">
                            <div class="text--med is--wulkan">Sun Chronicle</div>
                            <ul class="text--about list-items">


                                <li> Leading the industry for 45+ years
                                </li>
                                <li>Successfully delivered 80+ projects
                                </li>
                                <li>Over 17 Million sq. ft. of built-up area</li>
                                <li>A thriving community of 7700+ satisfied sun patrons</li>

                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div data-w-id="68032c8f-1186-6c0e-3f09-c2006e6223d6" class="horizontal-line"></div>
